    "identifier": "pain-barrage",
    "description": "<p>You leap in the air and spin while striking all targets in the area. All creatures, in a 10-foot cube centering on a point you can see within 30 feet, must make a Dexterity saving throw. On a failed save select creatures takes 2d12 piercing damage or half as much on a successful save.</p>\n<p>You then land in an unoccupied space you can see within the range of this jutsu.</p>\n<p>Chain 1: Creatures who failed their save, become Weakened until the end of their next turn.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the damage by 1d12.</p>",
